79 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 43 0 R
/T (Geometry affects growth and strength in 3D-printed mycelium composites [2]. In molded acoustic tiles the mycelium copied the mold texture, with small irregularities in strongly curved areas, and in fully closed molds the humidity stayed high and the surface did not fully harden [3]. Both points apply to my domes and to my closed mold.)
/E (Geometry affects growth and strength in 3D-printed mycelium composites [2]. In molded acoustic tiles the mycelium copied the mold texture, with small irregularities in strongly curved areas, and in fully closed molds the humidity stayed high and the surface did not fully harden [3]. Both points apply to my domes and to my closed mold.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
